# Run this test with the coroutine connection handler and reactor-side
# parsing enabled: the statement-priority taxonomy (sql/stmt_priority.h)
# is classified on the reactor after the parse, so without
# coroutine_reactor_parse=ON every counter delta below would be 0.
--thread-handling=coroutine-epoll
--coroutine-reactor-parse=ON
--coroutine-reactor-threads=2
--coroutine-executor-threads=8
--skip-log-bin
